    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "You started this journey with nothing but a dream...\nNo fancy tools,
    no experience, just passion in your heart and the hunger to make it big.\n\nYou
    faced chaos, angry customers, long queues, and endless pressure.\nYou burned
    dishes, lost orders, made mistakes \u2014 but never gave up.\nEvery upgrade,
    every recipe, every little plate served brought you one step closer to greatness.\n\nAnd
    now... look at you.\nFrom a tiny street stall to a 5-star empire \u2014 you\u2019ve
    built more than a restaurant.\nYou\u2019ve built a legacy.\n\nWe have no trophy
    to offer, no flashy fireworks, no grand prize...\nJust a simple truth:\nYou are
    not just a player \u2014 you\u2019re the soul of this story.\n\nNot all heroes
    wear aprons. But today, ours does.\nYou\u2019ve inspired us. You\u2019ve humbled
    us. You\u2019ve made this kitchen legendary.\"*\n\n\"Thank you, Chef. The world
    will remember your flavor.\""
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c7ff7d5895ed9ba46ad6271dacf8d840, type: 2}
